  "abstract_summary": "Persistent memory is the one attack surface of an LLM agent that outlives every session. Memory-poisoning attacks (MINJA, PoisonedRAG) are already packaged in open red-teaming frameworks, while the 2026 wave of runtime defenses guards actions inside a session and leaves storage undefended. This paper presents a memo...",
